nt retained/WORM custody, actual alert delivery and escalation, collector supervision deployment, service objectives and incident acceptance"}, {"area": "Deployment", "implemented": "アドバイザリ参照、ロックされたランタイムを実行", "remaining": "真の TLS/DNS 環境、オペレーションオーナー承認、セキュリティレビューが待機中", "source_file": "PRODUCTION_PLAN.md", "evidence_quote": "Real TLS/DNS environment, identity service, operating owner, target-environment upgrade/rollback and security review"}, {"area": "Business quality", "implemented": "元失敗を保存、合成比較停止、必須出力確認を追加を実行", "remaining": "10 回反復実際のソース実行、概要正しさ、レビューミス評価が待機中", "source_file": "PRODUCTION_PLAN.md", "evidence_quote": "Ten repeated actual-source runs, source/summary correctness, review miss/false-positive evaluation, latency and acceptance thresholds"}, {"area": "Contract / operation", "implemented": "技術的制限を文書化、虚偽承認なしを実行", "remaining": "所有者承認サービススコープ、SLO/SLA、サポート責任合意が待機中", "source_file": "PRODUCTION_PLAN.md", "evidence_quote": "Owner-approved service scope, SLO/SLA, support and incident responsibility; no invented approvals or certifications"}]}
